<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia unchanged at 1,885 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia unchanged at 1,885 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia was unchanged at 1.885 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>				    December 20	  December 19</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1,885		  1,885</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $6.99 million	    $20.27 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
